# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# A touchpad's two-finger scroll on Linux's xcb platform (GitHub
# mitcad/Mitcad#381) on the demo block, application events only: wheel
# steps with no phase and no pixel deltas from a touchpad device pan the
# view both ways in the Trackpad scheme, and with Alt a vertical move (its
# axes swapped, as xcb sends it) orbits vertically; a mouse wheel's whole
# and partial notches zoom. Run by tools/ui-navigation-device-scroll-test.sh
# (Linux), in the Floating and the Docked layout.
wait-idle
expect-viewport
expect-device-scroll
expect-never '^(TestDriver: FAIL|OCCT view event failed)'
